{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50597","headline":"易言 · 韦应物","name":"易言","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长风如刀剪枯叶，大河似箭浮轻舟。\n投石入水岂有碍，走丸下坂安得留。\n（见影印本《新编纂图增羣书类要事林广记》卷七。\n按《全唐诗》卷一九五收韦应物《易言》一首，与此诗全异。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50597.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50597","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}